00:24:40.094 --> 00:24:43.060
You know, you can live
down here with no money.

00:24:43.060 --> 00:24:45.949
Like people are really
good people down here.

00:24:45.949 --> 00:24:50.640
As crazy as it is, a lot
of them are on drugs.

00:24:50.640 --> 00:24:53.860
But if you're hitchhiking,
you can get a ride down here.

00:24:53.860 --> 00:24:55.360
If you don't got nowhere to stay,

00:24:55.360 --> 00:24:56.930
you can stay with your neighbor down here.

00:24:56.930 --> 00:25:00.190
Like people, everybody knows everybody.

00:25:00.190 --> 00:25:03.402
And it's like family down here, you know?

00:25:03.402 --> 00:25:06.739
So, but the reason people are on drugs

00:25:06.739 --> 00:25:10.704
is because they have
nothing else to turn to.

00:25:10.704 --> 00:25:14.700
You know, everybody wants to feel good.

00:25:14.700 --> 00:25:16.570
In the city, there's all
kinds of things you can go

00:25:16.570 --> 00:25:18.310
to make you feel good.

00:25:18.310 --> 00:25:21.120
You can go to the movies and
hang out with friends and.

00:25:21.120 --> 00:25:25.180
Down here, you can't do that,
there's no movie theater.

00:25:25.180 --> 00:25:27.110
There's no place for
kids other than church.

00:25:27.110 --> 00:25:29.200
And like I said, if you're down here,

00:25:29.200 --> 00:25:30.270
you might want to keep your kids out

00:25:30.270 --> 00:25:32.330
of this church down here.

00:25:32.330 --> 00:25:37.330
And drugs is like what everybody turns to.

00:25:37.680 --> 00:25:41.870
And then, like I said, they
call this the "City of Hope."

00:25:41.870 --> 00:25:44.150
I remember one time somebody
took some spray paint

00:25:44.150 --> 00:25:46.520
and knocked off the H and put a D there.

00:25:46.520 --> 00:25:49.780
And made it to say the
sign that coming in saying

00:25:49.780 --> 00:25:50.817
the "City of Dope."

00:25:52.480 --> 00:25:54.660
And drugs are worth a
lot more money down here

00:25:54.660 --> 00:25:57.270
than they are in the city.

00:25:57.270 --> 00:25:59.994
So with drugs being
worth a lot more money,

00:25:59.994 --> 00:26:02.728
even in the city, I know people like, oh,

00:26:02.728 --> 00:26:04.640
I'm buying all the drugs up

00:26:04.640 --> 00:26:06.120
and I'm bringing them down here.

00:26:06.120 --> 00:26:07.860
A lot of people transport
their drugs down here

00:26:07.860 --> 00:26:10.030
because they are worth more money.

00:26:10.030 --> 00:26:11.980
I'll tell you something else down here,

00:26:12.977 --> 00:26:14.710
like even the police,

00:26:14.710 --> 00:26:16.172
like I was talking about the government.

00:26:16.172 --> 00:26:18.790
Were you familiar with any
of that before you came?

00:26:18.790 --> 00:26:19.623
- [Interviewer] No.

00:26:19.623 --> 00:26:22.680
- Like our mayor getting locked
up for being a sex offender

00:26:22.680 --> 00:26:25.180
and he was sleeping with
like a 13 year old girl.

00:26:25.180 --> 00:26:29.000
We had 18 more elected
officials arrested at one time.

00:26:29.000 --> 00:26:31.350
And that's actually when my dad,

00:26:31.350 --> 00:26:33.280
I told you my dad sold one pill.

00:26:33.280 --> 00:26:36.170
That's actually why he ended
up getting arrested too,

00:26:36.170 --> 00:26:37.819
caught up in the election fraud.

00:26:37.819 --> 00:26:41.240
And he actually was one of the people

00:26:41.240 --> 00:26:43.120
who couldn't get away from, that got away

00:26:43.120 --> 00:26:44.670
from the election fraud.

00:26:44.670 --> 00:26:47.080
And the feds don't like
to lose so they came back

00:26:47.080 --> 00:26:48.782
and got him for anything they could.

00:26:48.782 --> 00:26:53.782
He actually gave a pill to a
guy who had a camera on him,

00:26:54.553 --> 00:26:57.609
and showed the guy good.

00:26:57.609 --> 00:26:58.920
The guy said to my dad like

00:26:58.920 --> 00:27:02.440
there was people out
acting crazy these days,

00:27:02.440 --> 00:27:04.230
and my dad pulled out a gun and said,

00:27:04.230 --> 00:27:05.610
let them act crazy around here.

00:27:05.610 --> 00:27:07.710
You know, I got something for him.

00:27:07.710 --> 00:27:09.527
And like I said, he gave the guy a pill

00:27:09.527 --> 00:27:11.030
and the guy said his back was hurting.

00:27:11.030 --> 00:27:13.760
And it wasn't no major pills,
it was a Lorsaid or something.

00:27:13.760 --> 00:27:16.810
You know, like a 10 or $15 pill down here.

00:27:16.810 --> 00:27:19.066
Very minor pill.

00:27:19.066 --> 00:27:23.360
And so he wore the camera and the wire,

00:27:23.360 --> 00:27:25.965
and they see my dad have the gun,

00:27:25.965 --> 00:27:30.280
give the guy a pill, and also
snort a pill with the guy.

00:27:30.280 --> 00:27:35.280
So they charged him with like
drug abuse by a gun owner

00:27:36.550 --> 00:27:37.383
or something like that.

00:27:37.383 --> 00:27:39.720
I guess, having a gun,
and even doing a drug

00:27:39.720 --> 00:27:40.973
like where he snorted it.

00:27:41.928 --> 00:27:43.130
What's that charge?

00:27:43.130 --> 00:27:44.740
I can't remember the charge.

00:27:44.740 --> 00:27:47.293
But he also got charged
with like a career criminal

00:27:47.293 --> 00:27:49.090
because when he was 18 years old,

00:27:49.090 --> 00:27:51.810
he hit a guy with an extinguisher

00:27:51.810 --> 00:27:54.420
and stole a hundred dollars
from him and then got robbery.

00:27:54.420 --> 00:27:55.410
And that was when I was born,

00:27:55.410 --> 00:27:59.040
he was in the hospital for that.

00:27:59.040 --> 00:28:02.250
I was actually conceived
in the jail down here.

00:28:02.250 --> 00:28:04.450
My uncle was the jailer.

00:28:04.450 --> 00:28:07.190
Before my dad went to prison,
my uncle let them go out

00:28:07.190 --> 00:28:09.140
to this little picnic area.

00:28:09.140 --> 00:28:11.064
And that's where I was conceived.

00:28:11.064 --> 00:28:13.764
That's what my dad tells me
right before he went away.

00:28:14.600 --> 00:28:15.670
- [Interviewer] Interesting.

00:28:15.670 --> 00:28:16.560
- Yeah.

00:28:16.560 --> 00:28:17.393
- [Interviewer] All right, Matthew.

00:28:17.393 --> 00:28:19.320
Well thank you so much for
sharing your interesting story.

00:28:19.320 --> 00:28:20.830
- [Matt] Yeah man.

00:28:20.830 --> 00:28:22.648
- [Interviewer] Because I
don't want to get anybody

00:28:22.648 --> 00:28:23.481
in trouble, but man, that's it.

00:28:23.481 --> 00:28:25.630
- [Matt] Okay, I say we get
that guy in trouble man,

00:28:25.630 --> 00:28:28.340
that might be another whole documentary

00:28:28.340 --> 00:28:31.030
getting into something like that.

00:28:31.030 --> 00:28:33.956
Like documenting, you know
that's a big topic right now

00:28:33.956 --> 00:28:38.265
of sex offending, people with power.

00:28:38.265 --> 00:28:39.098
- [Interviewer] Yeah.

00:28:39.098 --> 00:28:40.440
- [Matt] Which nobody here has got

00:28:40.440 --> 00:28:43.273
the kind of power that
